{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10IvorExtern15WorkPerformanceV5EventV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"WorkPerformance.Event","modules":[{"name":"IvorExtern"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"}],"extendedModule":"IvorExtern","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"One channel message at its time in a work, exactly as the work has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/event"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event\/init(time:message:partIndex:)"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event\/message","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event\/partIndex","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event\/time"],"generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event\/Comparable-Implementations","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Events at the same time are ordered note-offs first, then bank","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"selects (MSB, then LSB), then program changes, then pan (MSB, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"LSB), then expression (MSB, then LSB), then pedals (CC 64–68), then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any other control change, then note-ons, so that a note repeated back","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to back sounds again — with its new instrument, pan and expression,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"if they change there — and a pedal goes down before a note it should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hold. Notes that end where a pedal is re-pedaled are let go of first,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the pedal is still down, so its release frees them.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance\/Event","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/documentation\/IvorExtern\/WorkPerformance"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/SL","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorExtern\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"references":{"doc://IvorExtern/documentation/IvorExtern/WorkPerformance/Event/message":{"abstract":[{"text":"The message to send.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"message","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8IvorMIDI18MIDIChannelMessageO","text":"MIDIChannelMessage","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivorextern\/workperformance\/event\/message","title":"message","identifier":"doc:\/